            <div class="zn-element zn-lg  ">
              <h3 id="" class="zn-heading "   ><p>Located outside Pittsburgh, "it is one of the only places in Appalachia where the coal story is told not in a museum case, but in the walls themselves.” — From The Ruins website</p></h3>
            </div>
            
            
